    "sections": {
        "description": "Prime Tutor Academy is a premium, feature-packed, and versatile theme tailored for private tutoring services, academic coaching, online learning platforms, virtual classrooms, homeschooling support programs, after-school tutoring centers, e-learning startups, digital education hubs, personalized education services, skill development programs, online course websites, education consultancies, test prep centers, and career counseling services. Designed for educators, tutors, coaching institutes, and training centers, it supports a wide range of tutoring needs including math tutoring, science tutoring, English tutoring, language acquisition, coding, robotics, business studies, SAT/ACT prep, IELTS, TOEFL, K-12 tutoring, high school subject coaching, college entrance exam preparation, group tutoring sessions, one-on-one mentorship, study skills development, and special education support. The theme features a sleek, mobile-responsive layout with customizable banners, tutor profiles, interactive course listings, lesson schedules, student portals, and intuitive appointment booking tools through Contact Form 7 integration. With built-in call-to-action sections, secure payment support, social media connectivity, course catalogs, and SEO-friendly design, it is ideal for managing tutoring franchises, private academies, learning centers, or online educational platforms. Conversion-optimized, visually engaging, and easy to customize, Prime Tutor Academy empowers educators, trainers, and academic entrepreneurs to attract students, deliver structured learning experiences, and grow their professional online presence."
    },
